5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to make sure we pick something that actually lasts, even if things outside our control change.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. I suspect we might be repeating old mistakes if we don't look at what was tried before.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,We should also check if we actually have the staff skills to manage a new service.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I am concerned about the funding structure. We need to know how the grants and endowments are shaped.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I worry about the people who can't get to the library easily.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, you're right. Maybe we should check the bus links in the outer wards?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I'll take the lead on the historical records. Those programmes from six years ago seem relevant.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll look into the volunteer register and supervision training to see who we can actually rely on.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as last year's running and equipment lines.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Thank you, Yumi. I'll look into the bus links and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll check the winter road closures and the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll also look into the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use to see current patterns.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll add the neighbourhood associations and tool certification to my list.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,That covers the financial and logistical basics.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
