58,3,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
59,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Looking at the candidates, the Mobile Branch is too unstable with the roads and costs.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,The Digital Archive is risky given the past failure and the supplier delays Yumi mentioned.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,The Maker Workshop is a liability without a certified technician on staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,I agree. The Language Learning Circles seem the most fiscally sustainable if managed correctly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Language Circles could be hosted in the outer wards, helping those without bus links.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that's a great point. It brings the service to them without needing a library van.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,It aligns with the success of the previous partner-run groups. It's a proven model.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"As long as we rely on the partner organisations for the facilitation, the supervision gap is less critical.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,"And since it uses session fees from grants initially, it fits the budget better than buying a vehicle.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I feel much better about this. It addresses the accessibility issue.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm sold on the Language Learning Circles.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. It's the most logical choice based on the records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I can support it, provided the partners take the lead on instruction.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minako,,It is the most stable option for the long term.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for the Language Learning Circles.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
